{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04739","headline":"奉和圣制花蕚楼下宴应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制花蕚楼下宴应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万心翘乐宴，三舍缓昌时。\n山接夏云险，台留春日迟。\n节移芳未歇，兴隔赏仍追。\n醉後传嘉惠，楼前舞圣慈。\n皇恩与时合，天意若人期。\n故发前旬雨，新垂湛露诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}